# ===== ch5.6: 21 strings =====

    old "Hah… practice is off today, isn't it?{#ch5.6_th_001}"
    new "（はあ、今日は練習が休みか）"

    old "Wealthy-sama said that tomorrow the final casting will finally be announced...{#ch5.6_th_002}"
    new "（明日にはいよいよ役柄の最終発表をするって\\n　ウェザリーさんはいってたけど……）"

    old "I wonder how it's going to turn out? Really...{#ch5.6_th_003}"
    new "（どうなるんだろうな？\\n　本当に……）"

    old "It's a rare day off... what should I do?{#ch5.6_th_004}"
    new "（せっかくの休みだけど、どうしよ？）"

    old "Kirche and Haruna are rehearsing the play.{#ch5.6_th_005}"
    new "（キュルケとハルナが劇の練習をしてるな）"

    old "They're practicing with such enthusiasm, it's something I wouldn't have imagined.{#ch5.6_th_006}"
    new "（ずいぶん熱心に練習をしてるな。\\n　前からは考えられないくらいだ）"

    old "Huh? Louise and Guiche together? That's rare.{#ch5.6_th_007}"
    new "（あれっ？\\n　ルイズとギーシュとは珍しい組み合わせだな）"

    old "Could it be that Guiche... is hitting on Louise?!{#ch5.6_th_008}"
    new "（まさかギーシュのやつ！\\n　ルイズに色目でも使ってるのか！？）"

    old "Eat this, Guiche!{#ch5.6_th_009}"
    new "（喰らえ、ギーシュ！）"

    old "Hehehe. Heaven's punishment succeeded! Now for the second shot...{#ch5.6_th_010}"
    new "（ふふふ。\\n　天誅成功！\\n　続いて第２弾を……）"

    old "Huh? Siesta and Montmon... what a rare combination.{#ch5.6_th_011}"
    new "（あれっ？\\n　シエスタとモンモンって……。\\n　珍しい組み合わせもあったもんだな）"

    old "Even rare things happen.{#ch5.6_th_012}"
    new "（珍しいこともあるもんだな）"

    old "Huh? Tabitha and the princess are here. The princess looks quite troubled...{#ch5.6_th_013}"
    new "（あれ、タバサと、お姫さまがいる。\\n　ずいぶんお姫さまが困ってる\\n　みたいだけど……）"

    old "…….{#ch5.6_th_014}"
    new "……。"

    old "W-what's going on. This awkward atmosphere!{#ch5.6_th_015}"
    new "（な、なんだよ。\\n　この気まずい雰囲気は！）"

    old "…….{#ch5.6_th_016}"
    new "……。"

    old "W-was that too sudden?{#ch5.6_th_017}"
    new "（い、いきなりそれか？）"

    old "…….{#ch5.6_th_018}"
    new "……。"

    old "What a problem. What should I talk about?{#ch5.6_th_019}"
    new "（困ったなぁ。\\n　何の話題を話そう）"

    old "She seems happy. Can't put it into words, can she?{#ch5.6_th_020}"
    new "（なんだか、うれしそうだな。\\n　言葉にできないってやつかな？）"

    old "………. ……. ….{#ch5.6_th_021}"
    new "………。\\n……。\\n…。"
